{"case_id": "r1pdf:c20f0ec9e9d5958f62b304f8", "input_sha256": "837773864546111dc8bd6cafbc0d0c98cc354bab8adbe1a0238064204477a1e1", "raw_output": "```json\n{\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"D01:S01\"\n  ],\n  \"quotes\": [\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S01\",\n      \"quote\": \"The notation ATX(N) might be useful when conceptualizing the incorporation of new biomarker groups, where X represents an array of biomarkers that may become available in the future.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"证据D01:S01明确支持目标引用中关于“ATX(N)”表示法及其含义的主张。原文指出“ATX(N)”这一表示法在概念化新生物标志物组的纳入时可能有用，且“X”代表未来可能可用的一系列生物标志物。这直接对应了目标引用中“X indicated a new biomarker category beyond A, T, or (N)”的描述。虽然目标引用提到“2018 document”，而候选证据未明确标注年份，但候选证据内容（NIA-AA研究框架）与必要上下文中的“2018 framework”在主题和术语（AT(N)系统扩展）上高度一致，且D01:S01是唯一直接解释ATX(N)符号含义的候选证据。\"\n}\n```", "attempted": true, "observed_input": {"input_tokens": 2843, "required_total": 3355, "input_ids_sha256": "9202d47b60fbca83fc12f39ffcfa44fadce350b2b90c1312e209e948095bd7f1", "within_budget": true, "truncation": false, "generated_token_ids": [71093, 2164, 198, 90, 198, 220, 328, 68, 26590, 7824, 763, 498, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 16, 1, 198, 220, 10339, 198, 220, 328, 51492, 763, 498, 198, 262, 313, 198, 406, 328, 68, 26590, 816, 763, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 16, 487, 198, 406, 328, 2855, 763, 328, 760, 42727, 7135, 55, 7947, 8, 2493, 381, 5222, 948, 42351, 4694, 279, 84350, 314, 491, 37162, 12488, 5038, 11, 1332, 1543, 10551, 449, 1287, 314, 37162, 86944, 421, 1189, 3512, 2420, 303, 279, 3725, 1149, 198, 262, 333, 198, 220, 10339, 198, 220, 328, 19290, 763, 328, 100720, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 16, 98290, 97273, 97622, 102014, 95789, 97785, 2005, 802, 55, 7947, 94890, 97236, 95892, 101625, 100977, 99230, 96543, 1710, 98960, 99489, 2005, 802, 55, 7947, 94890, 97884, 97236, 95892, 95772, 99518, 95909, 95882, 98143, 99588, 96052, 110919, 109068, 95865, 96539, 110009, 3709, 97447, 2005, 55, 828, 96908, 98821, 96539, 104395, 117294, 98143, 99588, 96052, 1710,