{"case_id": "r1pdf:43c53ece80a7c35828d5246d", "input_sha256": "d4650b52a0e0602538dc3ac3d88f51e2f53fec25e713bf82ab536a676032bfbe", "raw_output": "```json\n{\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"D01:S06\"\n  ],\n  \"quotes\": [\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S06\",\n      \"quote\": \"the four Alzheimer’s continuum biomarker profiles are labeled a-d: (a) A+T−(N)−; (b) A+T+(N)−; (c) A+T+(N)+; and (d) A+T−(N)+\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"候选证据D01:S06明确列出了2018框架中用于数值分期的四个生物标志物简写组合（a-d），具体包括A+T−(N)−、A+T+(N)−、A+T+(N)+和A+T−(N)+。这支持了目标引用中关于使用AT(N)“加/减”组合作为非正式分期方案（informal staging scheme）的主张，并确认了这些组合在AD连续体中的具体定义。然而，候选证据未直接描述个体从A+T−N−到A+T+N−再到A+T+N+的预期进展顺序，因此仅部分支持关于组合使用的描述，未完全覆盖关于进展路径的具体主张。\"\n}\n```", "attempted": true, "observed_input": {"input_tokens": 3076, "required_total": 3588, "input_ids_sha256": "3d9c9ffdf35b5d50276cce35690f9fb4bb4e091460c7fed6ec47bf31efafe739", "within_budget": true, "truncation": false, "generated_token_ids": [71093, 2164, 198, 90, 198, 220, 328, 68, 26590, 7824, 763, 498, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 21, 1, 198, 220, 10339, 198, 220, 328, 51492, 763, 498, 198, 262, 313, 198, 406, 328, 68, 26590, 816, 763, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 21, 487, 198, 406, 328, 2855, 763, 328, 1719, 2943, 41995, 725, 82837, 37162, 12488, 20235, 513, 28853, 264, 1676, 25, 318, 64, 8, 357, 10, 51, 32160, 7, 45, 8, 32160, 26, 318, 65, 8, 357, 10, 51, 12975, 45, 8, 32160, 26, 318, 66, 8, 357, 10, 51, 12975, 45, 7030, 26, 321, 318, 67, 8, 357, 10, 51, 32160, 7, 45, 26614, 198, 262, 333, 198, 220, 10339, 198, 220, 328, 19290, 763, 328, 102486, 100720, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 21, 98290, 96609, 97329, 17, 15, 16, 23, 103994, 95789, 98618, 110745, 95880, 97928, 99593, 98143, 99588, 96052, 96558, 96674, 101673, 9616, 64, 1676, 46662, 97990, 98249, 32, 10, 51, 32160, 7, 45, 8, 32160, 5205, 32, 10, 51, 12975, 45, 8, 32160, 5205, 32, 10, 51, 12975, 45, 7030, 95793, 32, 10, 51, 32160, 7, 45, 7030, 1710, 95854, 97273, 95759, 97622, 102014, 95789, 97785, 96402, 802, 7947, 8, 