{"case_id": "r1pdf:0243ab815badba958177a9a8", "input_sha256": "f24bfa318806ad42aed6126d630a296c7ebc439c29792995a07ccd5a69b7fa55", "raw_output": "```json\n{\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"D01:S05\",\n    \"D01:S06\"\n  ],\n  \"quotes\": [\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S05\",\n      \"quote\": \"a scheme using three traditional syndromal categories and a six-stage numeric scheme\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S06\",\n      \"quote\": \"A numeric clinical staging scheme is defined only for individuals in the Alzheimer’s continuum.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"证据D01:S05明确提到该研究框架（research framework）中包含了“六阶段数值方案”（six-stage numeric scheme），支持目标引用中关于“六阶段数值临床分期方案”的描述。证据D01:S06进一步确认了“数值临床分期方案”（numeric clinical staging scheme）的定义及其适用范围，与目标引用中的术语一致。这些证据共同支持了目标引用中关于在研究框架中描述六阶段数值临床分期方案的主张。\"\n}\n```", "attempted": true, "observed_input": {"input_tokens": 2896, "required_total": 3408, "input_ids_sha256": "243fd79b26c2da474206cb57494982def3777cf8b109b74b856eab4969875c41", "within_budget": true, "truncation": false, "generated_token_ids": [71093, 2164, 198, 90, 198, 220, 328, 68, 26590, 7824, 763, 498, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 20, 487, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 21, 1, 198, 220, 10339, 198, 220, 328, 51492, 763, 498, 198, 262, 313, 198, 406, 328, 68, 26590, 816, 763, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 20, 487, 198, 406, 328, 2855, 763, 328, 64, 12490, 1608, 2250, 8343, 20652, 433, 278, 10736, 321, 264, 4590, 48470, 23311, 12490, 1, 198, 262, 2390, 198, 262, 313, 198, 406, 328, 68, 26590, 816, 763, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 21, 487, 198, 406, 328, 2855, 763, 328, 32, 23311, 14075, 46170, 12490, 369, 4364, 1132, 364, 7529, 303, 279, 41995, 725, 82837, 1149, 198, 262, 333, 198, 220, 10339, 198, 220, 328, 19290, 763, 328, 100720, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 20, 98290, 104252, 96382, 96605, 103994, 9616, 58426, 12263, 7313, 95789, 113745, 2005, 96752, 98007, 110745, 97791, 828, 9616, 48671, 48470, 23311, 12490, 46662, 97273, 97622, 102014, 95789, 97785, 2005, 96752, 98007, 110745, 98475, 105215, 97791, 828, 129984, 1710, 100720, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 21, 97286, 101632, 95759, 2005, 110745, 98475, 105215, 97791, 828, 9616, 19000, 14075, 46170, 12490, 7313, 119977, 101625, 120109, 3709, 95999, 97622, 102014, 96875, 114565, 98696, 1710, 97032, 100720, 97708, 97273, 95759, 97622, 102014, 95789, 97785, 95772, 96605, 103994, 95789, 99172, 96752, 98007, 110745, 98475, 105215, 97791, 99230, 96543, 1710, 1, 198, 92, 198, 71093, 248046], "generated_tokens": 243, "peak_GPU_allocated_bytes": 23923387392}, "parsed": {"status": "invalid_explanation_output", "validation_error": "Expecting value: line 1 column 1 (char 0)", "evidence_ids": [], "reason_unreviewed": null, "quote_locators": []}}
{"case_id": "r1pdf:0625d9ca3ef5bf2a22c6109b", "input_sha256": "1a2fa66840a8cc2a2c178998e959aa3fc33a8c4927dad902e9a6bcca53c27f24", "raw_output": "```json\n{\n  \"evidence_ids\": [\n    \"D01:S04\"\n  ],\n  \"quotes\": [\n    {\n      \"evidence_id\": \"D01:S04\",\n      \"quote\": \"These features of 2019-nCoV infection bear some resemblance to SARS-CoV and MERS-CoV infections.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"reason\": \"候选证据D01:S04明确指出2019-nCoV感染的临床特征（如发热、干咳、呼吸困难及CT表现）与SARS-CoV和MERS-CoV感染具有相似性（bear some resemblance）。这支持了目标引用中关于“临床特征相似”的主张。然而，目标引用具体声称“mimic those of SARS-CoV”（模仿SARS-CoV），而证据仅表明存在“相似性”（resemblance），且证据同时指出2019-nCoV在上呼吸道症状和肠道症状方面与SARS-CoV/MERS-CoV存在差异（few patients... had prominent upper respiratory tract signs... rarely developed intestinal signs... whereas about 20–25% of patients with MERS-CoV or SARS-CoV infection had diarrhoea）。因此，证据部分支持了临床特征相似的主张，但并未完全证实“mimic”（完全模仿/模拟）这一强主张，且证据涵盖了与MERS-CoV的相似性，而目标引用仅提及SARS-CoV。\"\n}\n```", "attempted": true, "observed_input": {"input_tokens": 3652, "required_total": 4164, "input_ids_sha256": "d12c271dd19d55e3dcd3aeb42a316b01810f3393f0b23032753fe470a6868c51", "within_budget": true, "truncation": false, "generated_token_ids": [71093, 2164, 198, 90, 198, 220, 328, 68, 26590, 7824, 763, 498, 198, 262, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 19, 1, 198, 220, 10339, 198, 220, 328, 51492, 763, 498, 198, 262, 313, 198, 406, 328, 68, 26590, 816, 763, 328, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 19, 487, 198, 406, 328, 2855, 763, 328, 9205, 4275, 314, 220, 17, 15, 16, 24, 5111, 190141, 18303, 11385, 1010, 66568, 310, 194806, 83197, 53, 321, 380, 4180, 83197, 53, 27978, 1149, 198, 262, 333, 198, 220, 10339, 198, 220, 328, 19290, 763, 328, 102486, 100720, 35, 15, 16, 72799, 15, 19, 145682, 17, 15, 16, 24, 5111, 190141, 106510, 98475, 99521, 9616, 96031, 110045, 5205, 146357, 5205, 131376, 96128, 1123, 97897, 7313, 95999, 50, 16548, 83197, 53, 95793, 44, 4180, 83197, 53, 98461, 97118, 100822, 95911, 9616, 65378, 1010, 66568, 71748, 95854, 97273, 95759, 97622, 102014